{"timestamp": "2025-08-09T00:37:14.572365", "function_name": "collect", "function_body": "  # Get the index for the target primitive\n  primitive_index = env.world.cookbook.index[primitive]\n\n  if primitive_index is None:\n      raise ValueError(f\"Primitive {primitive} not found in cookbook.\")\n\n  # Initialize actions list\n  actions = []\n\n  # Helper function to get current position and direction\n  def get_current_pos_dir():\n      return env._current_state.pos, env._current_state.dir\n\n  # Move to the nearest primitive\n  path_to_primitive = find_path(env._current_state.grid, get_current_pos_dir()[0], primitive_index)\n  actions.extend(move_along_path(path_to_primitive))\n\n  # Collect the primitive\n  actions.append(4)  # USE action to collect the primitive\n\n  return actions", "island_id": 5, "scores": {"3": -1}}
